{"id": "12th_tamil_u1_q003", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "tamil_nadai_azhagiyal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "form_content_relation", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நடை அழகியல் குறித்த தி.சு. நடராசனின் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n(i) அழகியல் என்பது கலைகளின் அடிப்படைப் பண்பு ஆகும்.\n(ii) மொழியியல் கூறுகளும் இலக்கிய அமைப்பியலும் ஒன்றுடன் ஒன்று பின்னிப் பிணைந்தவை.\n(iii) வடிவம் மட்டுமே கவிதையைத் தீர்மானிக்கிறது; உள்ளடக்கத்திற்குப் பங்கில்லை.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(i) மற்றும் (iii) மட்டுமே சரி", "B": "(ii) மற்றும் (iii) மட்டுமே சரி", "C": "(i) மற்றும் (ii) மட்டுமே சரி", "D": "(i), (ii), (iii) ஆகிய அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "வடிவமும் உள்ளடக்கமும் ஒன்றிணைந்தே கவிதையை முழுமையாக்குகின்றன; வடிவம் மட்டுமே தீர்மானிக்கிறது என்பது தவறான கூற்றாகும். எனவே (i) மற்றும் (ii) மட்டுமே சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the statements on stylistics and aesthetics:\n(i) Aesthetics is the fundamental property of all arts.\n(ii) Linguistic components and literary structuralism are inextricably intertwined.\n(iii) Form alone determines poetry; content has no role.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Only (i) and (iii) are correct", "B": "Only (ii) and (iii) are correct", "C": "Only (i) and (ii) are correct", "D": "All (i), (ii), and (iii) are correct"}, "explanation": "Form and content are dynamically dialectical; statement (iii) is false while (i) and (ii) are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 2, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 2", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 1", "Prose", "Theory Analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u1_q004", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "tamil_nadai_azhagiyal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "stylistic_terms_matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இலக்கியக் கலைச்சொற்களையும் அவற்றின் தன்மைகளையும் பொருத்துக:\n(a) நடை (Style) - 1. இலக்கிய வடிவத்தின் வெளிப்பாட்டு முறை\n(b) ஒலி நயம் (Phonetic rhythm) - 2. செய்யுளுக்கு ஓசையழகு தரும் உறுப்பு\n(c) சொல் வளம் (Diction) - 3. கவிஞன் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கும் கலைச்சொற்கள்\n(d) தொடரமைப்பு (Syntax) - 4. சொற்கள் வாக்கியமாக இணையும் கட்டமைப்பு", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "B": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "C": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1", "D": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4"}, "explanation": "நடை (வெளிப்பாட்டு முறை), ஒலி நயம் (ஓசையழகு), சொல் வளம் (தேர்ந்தெடுக்கும் சொற்கள்), தொடரமைப்பு (வாக்கியக் கட்டமைப்பு). நேர் பொருத்தம் a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match stylistic terms with their theoretical functions:\n(a) Style - 1. Mode of literary artistic expression\n(b) Phonetic rhythm - 2. Melodic acoustic beauty of verse\n(c) Diction - 3. Poetic lexical repertoire selected\n(d) Syntax - 4. Structural architectural pattern of sentences", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "B": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "C": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1", "D": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4"}, "explanation": "Direct correspondences of structural linguistic stylistic categories."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 3, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 3", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 1", "Prose", "Stylistic Terms"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u1_q005", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "tamil_nadai_azhagiyal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tolkappiyam_nadai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘நடைபெற்றியலும்’ என்று தொடக்க காலத்திலேயே நடை பற்றிக் குறிப்பிட்ட பழந்தமிழ் இலக்கண நூல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தொல்காப்பியம்", "B": "நன்னூல்", "C": "வீரசோழியம்", "D": "தண்டியலங்காரம்"}, "explanation": "தொல்காப்பியப் பொருளதிகாரச் செய்யுளியலில் தொல்காப்பியர் 'நடைபெற்றியலும்' என்று கவிதையின் நடையியல் தன்மையைக் குறிப்பிட்டுள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which ancient Tamil grammatical treatise referenced poetic style through the phrase 'Nadai pettriyazhum'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Tolkappiyam", "B": "Nannool", "C": "Veerasozhiyam", "D": "Thandiyalankaram"}, "explanation": "Tolkappiyar discussed the organic flow of literary style in the Seyyuliyal of Porulathikaaram."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 3, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 3", "url": null, "source_notes": null