{"id": "12th_tamil_u1_q047", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "ilanthamizhe", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "literary_titles", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சிற்பி பாலசுப்பிரமணியம் பெற்ற பட்டங்கள் மற்றும் சிறப்புகள் குறித்த சரியான கூற்றுகளைத் தேர்க:\n(i) இவர் கவிஞர், பேராசிரியர், மொழிபெயர்ப்பாளர், இதழாளர் எனப் பன்முக ஆளுமை கொண்டவர்.\n(ii) இவருக்குத் தஞ்சைத் தமிழ்ப் பல்கலைக்கழகத்தின் தமிழ் அன்னை விருது வழங்கப்பட்டுள்ளது.\n(iii) இவர் தமிழக அரசின் பாவேந்தர் விருதைப் பெற்றுள்ளார்.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(i) மற்றும் (ii) மட்டுமே சரி", "B": "(ii) மற்றும் (iii) மட்டுமே சரி", "C": "(i), (ii), (iii) ஆகிய அனைத்தும் சரி", "D": "(i) மட்டுமே சரி"}, "explanation": "சிற்பி பாலசுப்பிரமணியம் பன்முக ஆளுமை கொண்டவர்; தமிழ் அன்னை விருது, பாவேந்தர் விருது, இருமுறை சாகித்திய அகாதெமி என அனைத்தையும் பெற்றவர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Select the correct statements regarding Sirpi Balasubramaniam's honors:\n(i) He is a multifaceted personality: poet, academic, translator, and editor.\n(ii) Conferred the Tamil Annai Award by Thanjavur Tamil University.\n(iii) Honored with the Paavendhar Award by the Tamil Nadu State Government.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Only (i) and (ii) are correct", "B": "Only (ii) and (iii) are correct", "C": "All (i), (ii), and (iii) are correct", "D": "Only (i) is correct"}, "explanation": "All three statements accurately summarize his distinguished awards and academic profile."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 6, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 6", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 1", "Poetry", "Honors"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u1_q048", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "ilanthamizhe", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "prose_works_sirpi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சிற்பி பாலசுப்பிரமணியம் எழுதிய உரைநடை ஆய்வு நூல்களுள் ஒன்று எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பாரதி நினைவுகள்", "B": "கவிதை நாடகம்", "C": "தமிழியல் பார்வை", "D": "இலக்கியச் சிந்தனைகள் (மற்றும் மலையாளக் கவிதை வரலாறு)"}, "explanation": "சிற்பி அவர்கள் பல கவிதை நூல்களோடு 'இலக்கியச் சிந்தனைகள்', 'மலையாளக் கவிதை வரலாறு' உள்ளிட்ட உரைநடை ஆய்வு நூல்களையும் எழுதியுள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following is an analytical non-fiction/critical prose work by Sirpi Balasubramaniam?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Bharathi Ninaivugal", "B": "Kavithai Naatakam", "C": "Thamizhiyal Paarvai", "D": "Ilakkiya Sinthanaigal (and History of Malayalam Poetry)"}, "explanation": "In addition to poetry, he authored 'Ilakkiya Sinthanaigal' and critical literary histories."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 6, "chapter": null, "section": null, "refere