{"id": "12th_tamil_u1_q086", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "thambi_nellaiyapparukku", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "letter_date", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாரதியார் பரலி சு. நெல்லையப்பருக்கு இக்கடிதத்தை எந்த ஆண்டு, எந்தத் தேதியில் எழுதினார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1910 ஆகஸ்ட் 15", "B": "1915 டிசம்பர் 23", "C": "1918 ஜனவரி 26", "D": "1920 அக்டோபர் 2"}, "explanation": "பாரதியார் புதுச்சேரியிலிருந்து 1915-ஆம் ஆண்டு டிசம்பர் திங்கள் 23-ஆம் நாள் பரலி சு. நெல்லையப்பருக்கு இக்கடிதத்தை எழுதினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "On which date and year did Bharati write this historic letter to Parali S. Nellaiyappar?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "15 August 1910", "B": "23 December 1915", "C": "26 January 1918", "D": "2 October 1920"}, "explanation": "Bharati penned the letter from Puducherry on 23 December 1915."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 9, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 9", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 1", "Supplementary", "Letter Date"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u1_q087", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "thambi_nellaiyapparukku", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "nellaiyappar_intro", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பரலி சு. நெல்லையப்பர் குறித்த சரியான செய்திகளைத் தேர்க:\n(i) இவர் விடுதலைப் போராட்ட வீரர், கவிஞர், எழுத்தாளர், இதழாளர், பதிப்பாளர் எனப் பன்முகம் கொண்டவர்.\n(ii) பாரதியின் ‘கண்ணன் பாட்டு’, ‘நாட்டுப்பாட்டு’, ‘பாப்பா பாட்டு’ ஆகிய நூல்களை முதன்முதலில் பதிப்பித்தவர் இவரே.\n(iii) இவர் பாரதிதாசனைத் தவிர வேறு யாரையும் ஆதரிக்கவில்லை.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(i) மற்றும் (iii) மட்டுமே சரி", "B": "(ii) மற்றும் (iii) மட்டுமே சரி", "C": "(i) மற்றும் (ii) மட்டுமே சரி", "D": "(i), (ii), (iii) ஆகிய அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "நெல்லையப்பர் வ.உ.சி, பாரதி, பாரதிதாசன் உள்ளிட்ட பலருக்கும் உற்ற தோழராக விளங்கினார். எனவே கூற்று (iii) தவறானது, (i) மற்றும் (ii) சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Select the accurate statements regarding Parali S. Nellaiyappar:\n(i) Multifaceted freedom fighter, poet, author, journalist, and publisher.\n(ii) First publisher of Bharati's landmark works including 'Kannan Paattu', 'Naattu Paattu', 'Paappa Paattu'.\n(iii) He supported nobody other than Bharathidasan.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Only (i) and (iii) are correct", "B": "Only (ii) and (iii) are correct", "C": "Only (i) and (ii) are correct", "D": "All (i), (ii), and (iii) are correct"}, "explanation": "Nellaiyappar was a close confidant of V.O.C. and Bharati; statement (iii) is false while (i) and (ii) are true."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 11, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 11", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 1", "Supplementary", "Biography"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u1_q088", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "thambi_nellaiyapparukku", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "letter_core_ideology", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இக்கடிதத்தில் பாரதியார் வலியுறுத்தும் சமூகச் சீர்திருத்தக் கருத்துகள் யாவை?\n(i) தமிழ்நாட்டில் தொழில்கள் பெருக வேண்டும்; இயந்திரங்கள் பெருக வேண்டும்.\n(ii) பெண் விடுதலை வேண்டும்; பெண்களைத் தாழ்மைப்படுத்துவோர் தம் இரு கண்களையும் குத்திக் கொள்பவருக்கு இணையானவர்.\n(iii) சாதி மதப் பேதங்களை மறந்து தமிழ் மக்கள் அனைவரும் ஒன்றிணைந்து வாழ வேண்டும்.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(i) மற்றும் (ii) மட்டுமே சரி", "B": "(ii) மற்றும் (iii) மட்டுமே சரி", "C": "(i) மற்றும் (iii) மட்டுமே சரி", "D": "(i), (ii), (iii) ஆகிய அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "பாரதியார் கடிதத்தில் தொழில் வளர்ச்சி, பெண் விடுதலை, சாதிமத பேதமற்ற ஒற்றுமை ஆகிய அனைத்தையும் ஆணித்தரமாக வலியுறுத்தியுள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which social reform doctrines are forcefully championed by Bharati in this letter?\n(i) Industries and manufacturing machines must multiply throughout Tamil Nadu.\n(ii) Women must be emancipated; oppressing women is akin to blinding one's own eyes.\n(iii) Tamils must transcend caste and religious divisions to unite as one brotherhood.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Only (i) and (ii) are correct", "B": "Only (ii) and (iii) are correct", "C": "Only (i) and (iii) are correct", "D": "All (i), (ii), and (iii) are correct"}, "explanation": "All three revolutionary principles form the ideological bedrock of Bharati's letter."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 10, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 10", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 1", "Supplementary", "Social Philosophy"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u1_q089", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "thambi_nellaiyapparukku", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "women_oppression_quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘பெண்ணைத் தாழ்மை செய்தோன் தன் கண்ணைக் குத்திக் கொண்டான்’ - என்று பெண் விடுதலையை வலியுறுத்தியவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மகாகவி பாரதியார்", "B": "பெரியார்", "C": "திரு. வி. க.", "D": "அண்ணா"}, "explanation": "பெண்களுக்குக் கல்வி மறுப்பதும் அவர்களைத் தாழ்மைப்படுத்துவதும் தற்கொலைக்கு ஒப்பானது என்பதைப் பாரதியார் தன் கடிதத்தில் இவ்வாறு கூறுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who declared 'He who degrades woman pierces his own eye' demanding total gender justice?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Mahakavi Bharati", "B": "Periyar", "C": "Thiru. V. Ka.", "D": "Anna"}, "explanation": "Bharati forcefully equated the subjugation of women to self-inflicted blindness in this letter."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 10, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 10", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 1", "Supplementary", "Famous Quote"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u1_q090", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "thambi_nellaiyapparukku", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "nellaiyappar_periodicals", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பரலி சு. நெல்லையப்பர் ஆசிரியராகவும் துணையாசிரியராகவும் பணியாற்றிய இதழ்கள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "குடியரசு மற்றும் விடுதலை", "B": "சூரியோதயம், லோகோபகாரி, தேசபக்தன்", "C": "சுதேசமித்திரன் மட்டுமே", "D": "மணிக்கொடி"}, "explanation": "நெல்லையப்பர் 'சூரியோதயம்', 'லோகோபகாரி' இதழ்களில் துணையாசிரியராகவும், 'தேசபக்தன்' இதழில் ஆசிரியராகவும் பணியாற்றினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which journals and periodicals were edited by Parali S. Nellaiyappar?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kudi Arasu and Viduthalai", "B": "Sooriyodhayam, Lokopakari, Desabhakthan", "C": "Swadesamitran only", "D": "Manikkodi"}, "explanation": "Nellaiyappar edited Desabhakthan and was sub-editor for Sooriyodhayam and Lokopakari."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 11, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 11", "url