{"id": "12th_tamil_u1_q114", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar_identification", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "tamizhaai_ezhuthuvom", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "la_lha_zha_distinction", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘கலை, களை, கழை’ ஆகிய சொற்களின் சரியான பொருள் வரிசையைத் தேர்க:", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "களை = மூங்கில் ; கழை = நீக்குதல் ; கலை = வித்தை", "B": "கலை = வித்தை / ஓவியம் ; களை = தேவையற்ற புல் / நீக்குதல் ; கழை = மூங்கில்", "C": "கலை = மூங்கில் ; களை = ஆடை ; கழை = கல்வி", "D": "கலை = நீர் ; களை = மலை ; கழை = காடு"}, "explanation": "கலை (நுண்கலை/வித்தை/மான்), களை (பயிரில் உள்ள தேவையற்ற புல்/களை எடுத்தல்), கழை (மூங்கில்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the correct semantic series for homophones 'Kalai' (லை), 'Kalai' (ளை), and 'Kazhai' (ழை):", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kalai (ளை) = Bamboo ; Kazhai = Weeding ; Kalai = Art", "B": "Kalai (லை) = Art / Stag ; Kalai (ளை) = Weed / Fatigue ; Kazhai (ழை) = Bamboo", "C": "Kalai = Bamboo ; Kalai = Attire ; Kazhai = Education", "D": "Kalai = Water ; Kalai = Mountain ; Kazhai = Jungle"}, "explanation": "Kalai (retroflex/alveolar variants) systematically signify fine art, unwanted weed/fatigue, and bamboo respectively."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_