{"id": "12th_tamil_u1_q121", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar_identification", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "tamizhaai_ezhuthuvom", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ila_ilai_izhai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘இலை, இளை, இழை’ ஆகிய சொற்களின் பொருளை முறையே பொருத்துக:", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இலை = மரத்தின் இலை ; இளை = மெலிந்து போதல் ; இழை = நூல் இழை / ஆபரணம் செய்தல்", "B": "இலை = நூல் ; இளை = மரம் ; இழை = மெலிதல்", "C": "இலை = ஆடை ; இளை = மரம் ; இழை = நீர்", "D": "இலை = காற்று ; இளை = நிலம் ; இழை = ஆகாயம்"}, "explanation": "இலை (தாவரத்தின் இலை), இளை (உடம்பு இளைத்துப் போதல்/மெலிதல்), இழை (ஆடையின் நூல் இழை/தங்க நகை இழைத்தல்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the meanings of the homophonic triad 'Ilai' (லை), 'Ilhai' (ளை), and 'Izhai' (ழை):", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Ilai (லை) = Plant leaf ; Ilhai (ளை) = Emaciating / growing lean ; Izhai (ழை) = Thread filament / crafting ornament", "B": "Ilai = Thread ; Ilhai = Tree ; Izhai = Leanness", "C": "Ilai = Attire ; Ilhai = Tree ; Izhai = Water", "D": "Ilai = Air ; Ilhai = Land ; Izhai = Sky"}, "explanation": "Ilai denotes foliage; Ilhai denotes physical emaciation; Izhai denotes thread filaments or fine inlay work."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tami