{"id": "12th_tamil_u1_q126", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "tamizhaai_ezhuthuvom", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "mayangoli_pairs_matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மயங்கொலிச் சொற்களின் பொருளைப் பொருத்துக:\n(a) ஊன் - 1. மாமிசம் / தசை\n(b) ஊண் - 2. உணவு\n(c) திணை - 3. ஒழுக்கம் / நிலப்பிரிவு\n(d) தினை - 4. தானிய வகை", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "B": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "C": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1", "D": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2"}, "explanation": "ஊன் (மாமிசம்), ஊண் (உணவு), திணை (ஒழுக்கம்/நிலம்), தினை (தானியம்). நேர் பொருத்தம் a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the homophonous pairs with their precise meanings:\n(a) Oon (ன்) - 1. Flesh / Meat\n(b) Oon (ண்) - 2. Food / Meal\n(c) Thinai (ணை) - 3. Conduct / Landscape classification\n(d) Thinai (னை) - 4. Millet grain", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "B": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "C": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1", "D": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2"}, "explanation": "Direct correspondences distinguishing alveolar versus retroflex nasals."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12",