{"id": "12th_tamil_u1_q172", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "tnpsc_pyq_integration", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thandiyalankaram_two_lights", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தண்டியலங்கார உரை மேற்கோள் பாடலில் கூறப்படும் இருவகைச் சுடர்களில் ஒன்று ஞாயிறு; மற்றொன்று எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "திங்கள் (சந்திரன்)", "B": "விண்மீன் (நட்சத்திரம்)", "C": "மின்னல்", "D": "தமிழ்மொழி"}, "explanation": "பாடல் இரு சுடர்களை ஒப்பிடுகிறது: ஒன்று உலக இருளைப் போக்கும் ஞாயிறு (சூரியன்); மற்றொன்று மக்களின் அறியாமை அக இருளைப் போக்கும் தமிழ்மொழி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the Thandiyalankaram illustrative verse, one celestial luminary is the Sun; what is the other?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Moon", "B": "Star", "C": "Lightning", "D": "Tamil Language"}, "explanation": "The verse contrasts two illuminators: the physical Sun and the peerless Tamil language dispelling inner ignorance."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 8, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 8", "url": nu